stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> trialing: start 7-day trial
    [*] --> active: subscribe and pay
    trialing --> active: pay (convert the trial)
    trialing --> canceled: cancel (access ends now)
    trialing --> expired: trial period ends
    active --> active: renew / change plan
    active --> canceled: cancel (access kept until the period end)
    active --> expired: current period ends
    canceled --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
